\ Not supported yet (plan row TB2, small tactics 1): generalizing a = b in
\ decide (a = b) leaves the instance instDecidableEqNat a b of type
\ Decidable (a = b) where Decidable x is wanted, a result that is not type
\ correct: Lean's error, 99 here (exit 2).
\ Lean: theorem u_gen_type (a b : Nat) : decide (a = b) = decide (a = b) := by
\         generalize (a = b) = x
theorem u_gen_type
  Nat explicit: a  Nat explicit: b  a b = Decidable.decide a b = Decidable.decide =
:= by
  a b = by-generalize: x
  by-rfl
end u_gen_type
